<title>THAILAND: TABLE-Thai June foreign reserves US$32.4 bln.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Thai June foreign reserves US$32.4 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's foreign reserves fell to US$32.4 billion in June from $33.3 billion in May, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    THAI FOREIGN RESERVES	June 97	 May 97     June 96</p>
<p>					   32.4	   33.3	 39.8</p>
<p>Note - The reserve figures are in billion U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
